@startuml SD-07 Request Asset Movement
title SD-07 Request Asset Movement

actor "Monitor Staff" as Staff
participant "Monitor App" as App
participant "Movement API" as API
participant "Movement Service" as Service
database "Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS
participant "Registration App" as RegApp

Staff -> App: Select asset and destination
App -> API: POST /assets/movement/request
API -> Service: create_movement_request()
Service -> DB: Create pending request
Service -> DB: Set asset flow_status = movement_requested
DB --> Service: Commit success
Service --> API: Movement request
API -> WS: Broadcast asset_movement_requested
WS -> App: Update asset row
WS -> RegApp: Show pending request

@enduml